WEBVTT

01:28.550 --> 01:35.270
Our Secret
EP15

01:36.560 --> 01:37.369
Senior

01:40.240 --> 01:41.280
I'm so exhausted.

01:41.880 --> 01:43.450
Really, I'm so exhausted.

01:48.410 --> 01:50.970
It is myself who choose to be a re-attendee of College Entrance Examination.

01:52.600 --> 01:54.450
I have no right to complain about this.

01:57.369 --> 01:59.880
So no matter how hard it is or how exhausting it will be,

02:01.160 --> 02:02.690
I cannot stop fighting.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.770
But I'm also very scared.

02:07.130 --> 02:09.290
I don't know whether I've made the right decision

02:09.290 --> 02:10.490
to start all over again.

02:11.880 --> 02:12.520
Xianxian

02:13.490 --> 02:14.720
Compared with your peers,

02:15.240 --> 02:16.520
you are good enough.

02:19.050 --> 02:20.440
This is not enough.

02:22.880 --> 02:24.719
It is not even close to the life I want,

02:25.440 --> 02:27.050
and the person

02:28.050 --> 02:29.850
I wish to follow.

02:33.600 --> 02:34.600
The person.

02:35.640 --> 02:36.770
You mean Zhou Siyue, right?

02:43.880 --> 02:47.080
Zhou Siyue is so brilliant.

02:48.440 --> 02:51.210
I used to think that we were at the same level,

02:51.520 --> 02:53.330
and as long as I can work very hard,

02:53.330 --> 02:54.800
I can go to the same university with him.

02:56.410 --> 02:58.160
But he is too brilliant.

02:58.800 --> 02:59.880
I just found out that

03:00.160 --> 03:03.210
there's a large gap between us.

03:04.050 --> 03:06.160
No matter how much I like him,

03:07.000 --> 03:09.690
I cannot stand that I'm not good enough for him.

03:13.410 --> 03:15.160
I'm afraid, one day,

03:16.520 --> 03:17.600
someone may ask

03:19.690 --> 03:21.130
why Zhou Siyue is

03:21.130 --> 03:22.690
with me.

03:31.880 --> 03:32.490
I don't think so.

03:33.930 --> 03:34.690
At least,

03:35.690 --> 03:36.520
I won't ask a question like this.

03:39.210 --> 03:40.410
If I were you,

03:41.640 --> 03:43.410
I won't be affected by others' voice

03:44.719 --> 03:46.330
as long as I have made my determination.

03:50.770 --> 03:51.969
Don't ask for too much.

03:54.330 --> 03:55.440
That's the best answer.

04:21.010 --> 04:22.849
Drink the milk and go to bed early.

04:23.360 --> 04:24.130
Thanks, mom.

04:24.970 --> 04:27.240
It's nearly midnight. Don't stay up too late.

04:29.730 --> 04:30.290
Mom

04:34.690 --> 04:35.320
Don't worry.

04:36.010 --> 04:37.200
I'll go to bed early today.

05:05.200 --> 05:06.450
Zhou Siyue

05:12.570 --> 05:14.080
I miss you so much.

05:24.200 --> 05:25.360
I'm so exhausted.

05:26.450 --> 05:28.040
Really, I'm so exhausted.

05:52.320 --> 05:53.760
School starts today, right?

05:54.360 --> 05:57.130
Congratulations on becoming a student of Huaqing University.

05:59.200 --> 06:00.170
I'm sorry.

06:01.080 --> 06:02.080
For such a long time,

06:02.570 --> 06:03.800
you have been so tired.

06:17.690 --> 06:18.290
Thank you.

06:35.480 --> 06:35.850
Hi.

06:36.410 --> 06:38.130
Do you know how to get the Automation Department?

06:39.480 --> 06:40.040
No, I don't.

06:40.200 --> 06:40.920
What's your major then?

06:41.410 --> 06:43.040
-I also major in automation.  -You major in automation, too?

06:43.890 --> 06:45.170
Nice to meet you. I'm Yuan Fang.

06:46.450 --> 06:47.130
I'm Zhou Siyue.

06:53.850 --> 06:54.570
Boys and girls.

06:55.570 --> 06:57.570
This is the first lesson for your new school life here.

06:58.170 --> 06:59.730
I hope you can remember the eight characters

07:00.130 --> 07:01.920
deep in mind.

07:02.480 --> 07:04.800
Never forget our responsibility and mission.

07:11.640 --> 07:13.290
You made a mistake on such an easy question?

07:14.170 --> 07:15.320
Just this one.

07:15.320 --> 07:16.760
You're asking too much of me.

07:17.080 --> 07:18.610
You have so many excuses.

07:18.920 --> 07:19.520
Silly girl.

07:20.200 --> 07:21.610
What were you thinking?

07:22.130 --> 07:23.850
If I did all these correct,

07:25.010 --> 07:27.130
I would be the one who got 90 points.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.360
So many excuses.

07:41.170 --> 07:41.730
Professor Ye

07:42.290 --> 07:42.799
-Good morning.  -Good morning.

07:43.170 --> 07:43.970
My name's Dong Zhengfei.

07:44.450 --> 07:46.080
For the member selection of the research group,

07:46.080 --> 07:47.080
I've got an idea.

07:47.450 --> 07:49.920
I'm thinking about designing a relevant network like this.

07:50.570 --> 07:51.920
Please have a look when you're free.

07:52.480 --> 07:55.240
Boy, it's good to have your own idea.

07:55.520 --> 07:58.080
You can show this while attending the election later.

07:58.970 --> 07:59.570
You may go back now.

08:00.640 --> 08:01.850
Okay, Professor Ye.

08:04.080 --> 08:04.610
Siyue

08:05.480 --> 08:06.170
I'm just going to see you.

08:06.570 --> 08:07.130
Professor Ye

08:08.240 --> 08:09.410
This semester, you don't need to attend

08:09.850 --> 08:10.730
the course of Introduction to Artificial Intelligence.

08:11.610 --> 08:12.570
I've seen your homework.

08:13.130 --> 08:13.970
It's beyond my expectation.

08:14.570 --> 08:15.410
So I want you to

08:16.010 --> 08:17.170
concentrate on the preparation for

08:17.320 --> 08:18.640
the assessment of my lab.

08:20.480 --> 08:22.570
Okay. I got it.

08:23.290 --> 08:24.360
How's your father?

08:26.570 --> 08:27.920
He's busy with the investigation.

08:28.890 --> 08:31.320
But I believe the time will soon come to reveal the whole truth.

08:32.570 --> 08:34.610
Okay. Don't worry.

08:35.199 --> 08:36.000
Just focus on your study.

08:36.610 --> 08:37.610
You are a promising student.

08:38.170 --> 08:38.929
Thank you, Professor Ye.

08:56.810 --> 09:00.200
Zhou Siyue, are you busy recently?

09:21.560 --> 09:23.080
In medical field,

09:23.170 --> 09:25.970
humanoid robots can be used in prosthetic

09:26.080 --> 09:27.200
and organ transplantation.

09:28.250 --> 09:29.930
Making use of the technology of humanoid robot,

09:29.970 --> 09:31.610
powered prosthesis can be created

09:31.930 --> 09:33.810
to help realizing paralytic patients'

09:33.880 --> 09:35.610
dream of walking again.

09:37.170 --> 09:39.520
We have such a handsome classmate.

09:40.730 --> 09:41.490
He's in Class One.

09:41.640 --> 09:43.930
It's said that he was recommended for admission from Shen Hai High School.

09:44.250 --> 09:44.850
He's a brilliant student.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.520
So in this respect,

09:46.970 --> 09:49.200
a deeper research and investigation is still needed.

09:49.560 --> 09:50.250
Wait and see.

09:50.850 --> 09:52.080
He's mine.

09:52.410 --> 09:53.250
Thank you.

09:53.730 --> 09:54.370
There you go again.

09:54.520 --> 09:55.810
Bravo! Bravo!

09:56.290 --> 09:56.930
Thank you.

09:57.370 --> 09:58.810
Bravo! Bravo!

10:00.050 --> 10:00.730
Good for you.

10:01.290 --> 10:02.170
The applause thundered forth.

10:11.730 --> 10:13.320
If you want to see him, just go.

10:15.000 --> 10:17.200
He doesn't reply to my messages now.

10:17.850 --> 10:18.970
He may be quite busy.

10:19.880 --> 10:21.170
How busy can he be?

10:21.320 --> 10:23.080
I'm a university student, too.

10:24.640 --> 10:25.410
Just forget it.

10:26.170 --> 10:27.370
I don't have time to see him.

10:28.290 --> 10:29.490
Aren't you free during the National Day holiday?

10:30.170 --> 10:32.610
Well, I'm free that time. But...

10:32.730 --> 10:34.050
Then why are you hesitating?

10:34.810 --> 10:35.850
You always want to

10:35.850 --> 10:37.370
visit Huaqing University, don't you?

10:37.680 --> 10:40.120
Just take this as a surprise for Zhou Siyue.

10:41.760 --> 10:42.640
A surprise?

10:56.730 --> 10:59.120
Where's the Automation Department?

11:21.490 --> 11:22.000
Hello.

11:23.640 --> 11:24.170
Hi.

11:24.490 --> 11:25.200
My name's Xing Lufei.

11:25.490 --> 11:27.120
I'm in Class Five of the Computer Department.

11:27.290 --> 11:28.410
Can I make friends with you?

11:30.640 --> 11:31.250
Well,

11:31.520 --> 11:33.850
I listened to your report that day when attending the election.

11:33.850 --> 11:35.120
And I think you are awesome.

11:35.520 --> 11:37.440
So I want to discuss with you

11:37.440 --> 11:38.680
some questions about study.

11:39.760 --> 11:40.320
I'm sorry.

11:40.930 --> 11:42.170
I'm quite busy today.

11:53.520 --> 11:54.850
This is our lab.

11:55.490 --> 11:56.520
At present, in China,

11:56.880 --> 11:58.930
whether in terms of the equipment or technology,

11:59.370 --> 12:00.880
it is in the leading position.

12:02.760 --> 12:03.850
There are few such advanced laboratories

12:03.850 --> 12:05.000
in the whole country.

12:07.200 --> 12:09.250
Siyue, come and have a look at the equipment.

12:11.200 --> 12:12.320
Sorry, I'm late. Professor Ye.

12:12.440 --> 12:13.250
I went to a wrong lab just now.

12:14.760 --> 12:16.120
New members are all here, now.

12:16.680 --> 12:17.250
Siyue

12:17.970 --> 12:19.930
As the group leader of your grade in our department,

12:20.410 --> 12:21.730
you are responsible for the connecting with

12:22.000 --> 12:22.760
your seniors.

12:24.370 --> 12:25.970
The rest of you can visit the lab, now.

12:26.610 --> 12:27.520
Okay. Thank you, Professor.

12:28.170 --> 12:28.850
yah professor

12:29.410 --> 12:31.080
I'm an intern team member.

12:34.560 --> 12:35.320
Senior

12:35.440 --> 12:36.880
Project progress data of the laboratory

12:37.120 --> 12:37.970
can be found in the computer.

12:38.520 --> 12:39.410
These are the relevant research topics.

12:40.000 --> 12:40.730
You may read by yourself.

12:43.490 --> 12:44.850
You top students

12:44.850 --> 12:46.080
are all so unfriendly?

12:47.250 --> 12:48.370
Why are you still here?

12:49.200 --> 12:51.610
Because I'm curious about the world of you genius

12:51.610 --> 12:52.880
and want to take a look with my own eyes.

12:55.080 --> 12:56.930
To be honest, I think you are indeed a brilliant student.

12:57.490 --> 12:58.880
As a freshman,

12:58.880 --> 12:59.970
it is good enough to know

12:59.970 --> 13:01.200
how to write the code.

13:01.490 --> 13:02.290
While you are

13:02.290 --> 13:04.120
ready to learn how to make robots.

13:07.730 --> 13:09.000
What's this?

13:09.680 --> 13:11.930
Don't touch things in the laboratory casually.

13:14.410 --> 13:15.970
Siyue, congratulations.

13:16.880 --> 13:18.250
You are the group leader now.

13:18.930 --> 13:20.880
The research topic you reported last time was pretty good.

13:22.170 --> 13:22.680
Thank you.

13:23.760 --> 13:24.680
We can talk about it

13:24.760 --> 13:25.680
someday when we are free.

13:26.410 --> 13:26.930
Okay.

13:47.250 --> 13:47.880
Look,

13:48.050 --> 13:49.930
this is our school post bar.

13:50.080 --> 13:50.730
Yeah.

13:50.930 --> 13:52.200
How could this happen?

13:52.930 --> 13:53.970
His son is right there.

13:54.200 --> 13:55.170
He is the son?

13:56.680 --> 14:00.680
Professor of Academy of Fine Arts in Huaqing University is suspected of academic fraud.

14:01.410 --> 14:02.520
The son of him

14:03.410 --> 14:04.520
was admitted to Huaqing University by pulling strings.

14:04.640 --> 14:05.760
What's this?

14:06.370 --> 14:07.520
Yeah.

14:08.520 --> 14:09.000
It's him.

14:09.490 --> 14:11.320
What's the matter? Are you okay?

14:14.610 --> 14:15.680
I hope not.

14:25.440 --> 14:28.250
Use the vulgar means of controlling the host to send information.

14:29.610 --> 14:31.640
It seems that you want me to know that you did it

14:33.000 --> 14:34.520
You must be mistaken.

14:34.970 --> 14:37.490
I've sent a message to the phone that controls the host

14:37.490 --> 14:38.610
by means of the network.

14:39.440 --> 14:40.560
He posted this.

14:41.170 --> 14:42.170
He did this.

14:45.050 --> 14:45.850
Zhou Siyue

14:46.440 --> 14:47.970
The academic misconduct of your father

14:48.370 --> 14:49.370
is no news at all.

14:50.050 --> 14:51.170
Stop arguing for him.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.930
Hope you will never do things

14:54.370 --> 14:55.200
you father has already done.

14:58.640 --> 14:59.440
Finished?

15:01.810 --> 15:02.490
Yeah.

15:03.610 --> 15:04.410
What can you do with me?

15:04.930 --> 15:05.440
Sue me?

15:08.170 --> 15:09.250
Stop. Stop.

15:09.250 --> 15:10.200
Stop it.

15:11.610 --> 15:12.520
Calm down.

15:12.730 --> 15:14.120
Yeah. Calm down.

15:21.440 --> 15:22.120
Are you okay?

15:23.520 --> 15:24.680
My ankle...

15:29.930 --> 15:31.760
I sprained my ankle because of you.

15:33.170 --> 15:35.170
Can't you take me to the school infirmary?

16:37.440 --> 16:38.080
Let's go.

16:40.200 --> 16:41.410
It hurts.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.489
Zhou Siyue

17:20.440 --> 17:22.040
I have to study hard for the examination.

17:23.080 --> 17:25.009
Let's stop contacting each other from now on.

17:53.730 --> 17:54.440
Perhaps,

17:54.440 --> 17:56.850
from the moment I decided to repeat a school year,

17:58.530 --> 18:00.440
the life tracks of us

18:00.440 --> 18:01.920
have already been staggered.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.850
I'm apart from everyone,

18:06.800 --> 18:08.160
and my life gradually deviates from the original track.

18:09.970 --> 18:12.370
I thought all can back to normal eventually,

18:14.040 --> 18:15.160
but I forgot

18:16.610 --> 18:19.280
that you have already

18:19.280 --> 18:20.730
begun your new life.

19:44.650 --> 19:45.680
We are about to usher in

19:45.680 --> 19:47.920
December 21st, 2012.

19:48.320 --> 19:50.320
It's said to be the end of the world in Mayan culture.

19:51.490 --> 19:52.400
If one day,

19:52.850 --> 19:54.800
we all disappear from the world,

19:55.560 --> 19:56.490
who do you hope

19:56.920 --> 19:58.800
to be with you that day?

19:59.080 --> 20:02.800
What do you think the end of the world

20:03.650 --> 20:05.280
in 2012 is like?

20:06.320 --> 20:07.280
I think

20:07.560 --> 20:09.250
it's just like what the movie has shown to us.

20:09.850 --> 20:11.650
Earthquake, tsunami,

20:12.160 --> 20:13.400
and volcanic eruption.

20:21.490 --> 20:23.770
It's December 21st, now.

20:24.250 --> 20:26.080
Who's with you?

20:42.280 --> 20:45.530
If the end of the world is about to come,

20:46.250 --> 20:47.650
I hope

20:48.040 --> 20:49.560
there will be fireworks all over the sky

20:50.320 --> 20:51.730
So that we can face death

20:52.610 --> 20:53.650
with the last beauty.

22:17.680 --> 22:20.250
The fireworks of the end of the world disappeared in the sky.

22:21.530 --> 22:22.650
But it let me

22:22.650 --> 22:24.280
see a new dawn on the night

22:24.850 --> 22:26.800
before the coming of destruction.

22:29.890 --> 22:32.610
If tomorrow is the end of the world,

22:34.320 --> 22:36.440
the last one I want to see

22:37.920 --> 22:39.280
is you.

22:41.730 --> 22:42.610
Zhou Siyue

22:44.010 --> 22:45.680
Wait for me in Huaqing.

23:21.280 --> 23:22.010
Zhou Siyue

23:23.400 --> 23:24.080
I'm sorry.

23:24.650 --> 23:27.370
I'd like to join Dong Zhengfei's research group.

23:29.040 --> 23:29.680
Okay.

23:30.250 --> 23:31.010
Good luck.

23:40.850 --> 23:41.560
Boss

23:42.970 --> 23:43.680
Are you serious?

23:44.890 --> 23:45.650
Yeah.

23:47.280 --> 23:49.280
Dong Zhengfei has recruited our members like this for weeks.

23:49.280 --> 23:50.200
You don't know this?

23:50.680 --> 23:52.490
Our research topic is humanoid robot.

23:52.610 --> 23:53.650
There are many uncertainties.

23:54.320 --> 23:56.490
She feels it's hard to continue the topic.

23:57.280 --> 23:59.010
Do you want me to burn her boat?

23:59.770 --> 24:00.850
At first, her academic performance was at the bottom

24:01.440 --> 24:02.970
and no group but us accepted her.

24:04.770 --> 24:05.370
Now she has learned the skills.

24:06.010 --> 24:07.490
And the research is in the middle, she kicks down the ladder now.

24:08.560 --> 24:10.010
Where can I find someone else to design the drive mechanism?

24:10.530 --> 24:13.040
Don't worry. It's not that difficult to find one.

24:15.250 --> 24:17.400
If we depend on your relations with others,

24:18.160 --> 24:18.970
it is very difficult indeed.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.320
Don't you aware that

24:23.490 --> 24:24.800
in the beginning you was a loner?

24:25.160 --> 24:26.080
You didn't talk with others

24:26.730 --> 24:28.080
and they didn't know you.

24:28.650 --> 24:30.200
So they all thought you were arrogant.

24:31.010 --> 24:33.530
It's only me who want to stay and be in the same group with you.

24:34.800 --> 24:35.610
Yeah.

24:36.440 --> 24:37.680
I should really be grateful

24:37.680 --> 24:39.080
for you being there with me.

24:39.770 --> 24:40.530
That's not necessary.

24:40.970 --> 24:43.280
We should try to find a qualified member, now.

24:43.770 --> 24:44.490
Don't worry.

24:45.080 --> 24:47.370
At worst, I can just spend more time doing it myself.

24:48.040 --> 24:49.730
You only sleep for five hours a day, now.

24:49.800 --> 24:50.650
Are you out of your mind?

24:52.890 --> 24:53.920
You know I'm tired.

24:54.400 --> 24:55.560
Then go back to work now.

24:59.770 --> 25:00.320
Boss

25:01.130 --> 25:01.650
You see,

25:02.610 --> 25:05.200
I've stayed here for two days.

25:05.680 --> 25:07.610
I'm longing to take half a day off this afternoon.

25:08.530 --> 25:09.400
There are many new girls in campus today.

25:10.040 --> 25:10.850
If I miss the chance to know them,

25:11.320 --> 25:12.160
I'll regret all my life.

25:18.280 --> 25:20.490
Always think about this stuff.

25:21.650 --> 25:22.130
Just go.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.010
Thank you.

25:25.970 --> 25:26.490
I'll go now.

25:59.400 --> 26:01.010
I don't know Zhou Siyue's new number.

26:01.010 --> 26:02.160
Do you find him now?

26:07.010 --> 26:08.280
Where's Zhou Siyue?

26:08.770 --> 26:10.490
I don't even know where I am now.

26:29.080 --> 26:30.530
This is unbelievable.

26:32.440 --> 26:33.730
All have gone

26:34.650 --> 26:35.490
in such a short time

26:36.610 --> 26:37.560
A girl is just over there.

26:41.320 --> 26:41.890
You may go now.

26:43.800 --> 26:44.850
Good brother.

26:45.800 --> 26:46.610
Wait, wait.

26:47.010 --> 26:48.130
Do you know what to say?

26:48.680 --> 26:49.370
No.

26:51.010 --> 26:51.800
Buddy, come here.

26:52.610 --> 26:54.490
Thank you.

26:56.490 --> 26:59.080
You should be obliging

26:59.370 --> 27:01.040
and take the girl and her luggage to the dormitory

27:01.320 --> 27:02.400
in case of others offering help to her.

27:07.560 --> 27:08.530
I got it.

27:08.650 --> 27:10.250
Okay. Okay. Go.

27:11.160 --> 27:11.890
Come on.

27:15.010 --> 27:16.890
Hi, why are you here alone?

27:20.490 --> 27:21.130
You must get lost.

27:22.610 --> 27:23.890
You are going to the girls' dormitory, aren't you?

27:24.560 --> 27:25.280
I'll take you there.

27:26.890 --> 27:29.250
I don't go to the girls' dormitory. I'm going to the boys' dormitory.

27:29.680 --> 27:31.400
Don't worry. I'm not a bad guy.

27:31.400 --> 27:32.890
Look. I'm a volunteer.

27:33.280 --> 27:35.080
It's my duty to help you.

27:35.440 --> 27:36.530
No, thanks.

27:36.530 --> 27:37.610
I don't need your help.

27:37.610 --> 27:39.040
It's okay.

27:39.040 --> 27:41.490
It's okay. Leave her alone. You rascal.

27:43.200 --> 27:45.080
You always say that you are a volunteer

27:45.970 --> 27:46.650
and do such things every year.

27:47.400 --> 27:48.080
But bro, just now you...

27:48.080 --> 27:48.970
What? What?

27:48.970 --> 27:50.040
Who's your bro?

27:50.610 --> 27:51.610
Save it.

27:53.160 --> 27:54.920
There are many liars like him every year.

27:55.650 --> 27:56.370
If you need

27:56.650 --> 27:58.560
help and...

27:59.400 --> 28:01.280
You bad guy.

28:02.490 --> 28:03.680
Stop following me.

28:04.130 --> 28:05.130
No, thanks.

28:10.650 --> 28:12.730
Zhou Siyue's character and academic performance are all excellent.

28:12.730 --> 28:13.800
He is handsome and modest.

28:14.200 --> 28:16.130
If Dong Zhengfei gets the chance,

28:16.130 --> 28:16.850
I won't agree.

28:17.160 --> 28:18.770
He's not that excellent.

28:19.130 --> 28:20.650
A crooked stick throws a crooked shadow.

28:21.080 --> 28:22.610
I don't want to join his research group.

28:22.680 --> 28:23.560
Something bad will happen sooner or later.

28:40.610 --> 28:41.490
Girl

28:42.370 --> 28:43.440
This is boys' dorm.

28:43.610 --> 28:44.610
Girls can't go in.

28:44.890 --> 28:46.040
I know. I'm a freshman.

28:46.080 --> 28:47.010
I just want to find someone there.

28:47.010 --> 28:48.280
No. You can't break the school rules.

28:48.280 --> 28:49.080
Just two minutes.

28:49.080 --> 28:49.770
Why don't you listen to me?

28:49.770 --> 28:50.160
Just two minutes.

28:50.160 --> 28:50.770
No way.

28:51.920 --> 28:53.400
Stop this or I'll call the security office.

29:01.530 --> 29:02.770
Zhou Siyue

29:03.970 --> 29:06.280
Zhou Siyue, I've come here for you.

29:09.970 --> 29:11.440
There is a girl downstairs in the boys' dormitory,

29:11.610 --> 29:12.730
chasing her love.

29:12.890 --> 29:15.250
Really? What a love story!

29:21.160 --> 29:22.610
Zhou Siyue

29:31.730 --> 29:33.680
The secret hidden in the bottom of my heart

29:34.530 --> 29:35.320
was carefully

29:35.320 --> 29:37.490
sealed in a dusty box by me.

29:39.200 --> 29:43.080
But one day the box will be opened again.

29:45.080 --> 29:47.320
I thought I had forgotten everything,

29:48.530 --> 29:52.440
only to realize that I never really let it go.

30:11.770 --> 30:13.560
Zhou Siyue

30:16.280 --> 30:16.890
Ding Xian

31:18.010 --> 31:18.890
Zhou Siyue

31:21.250 --> 31:22.610
Happy to see you.

31:29.530 --> 31:31.890
I called you, but you didn't answer. I sent you messages and you didn't reply, either.

31:32.370 --> 31:34.130
I thought you wouldn't see me again.

31:35.320 --> 31:37.530
I've changed my phone number. I didn't tell you.

31:42.280 --> 31:44.560
I want to say something to you.

31:47.490 --> 31:48.080
Okay.

31:52.280 --> 31:53.440
I like you.

31:55.490 --> 31:56.650
Have you ever liked me?

32:05.800 --> 32:06.370
Ding Xian

32:08.800 --> 32:10.610
I don't want to be in a relationship right now.

32:16.850 --> 32:18.400
It's getting late. You may go back now.

32:20.130 --> 32:21.160
Work hard in the future

32:21.890 --> 32:22.800
and don't come to me again.

32:33.080 --> 32:34.800
We made an appointment to go to Huaqing University together.

32:36.370 --> 32:37.800
And I worked so hard to try to follow your steps.

32:39.650 --> 32:40.650
I made it.

32:43.890 --> 32:44.770
I just want to know

32:44.770 --> 32:46.530
whether you've liked me or not.

32:52.800 --> 32:54.610
Liked or not.

32:56.400 --> 32:57.280
Does it matter?

33:02.890 --> 33:03.490
Ding Xian

33:07.610 --> 33:09.730
Now we both have our own lives.

33:11.130 --> 33:12.010
So what?

33:40.970 --> 33:41.920
Zhou Siyue

33:44.160 --> 33:45.800
Do you know my secret?

33:57.560 --> 33:58.890
It's getting late. I've got to go.

34:46.160 --> 34:46.680
Hi,

34:47.879 --> 34:49.089
I want to ask

34:49.089 --> 34:52.120
whether the patient in Bed 2 of Room 318 has paid the bill.

34:52.490 --> 34:53.359
Wait a minute.

34:54.250 --> 34:55.970
Bed 2 of Room 318, right?

34:58.050 --> 34:58.810
Not yet.

34:59.680 --> 35:00.770
Are you his family member?

35:02.530 --> 35:03.640
You'd better pay the bill as soon as possible.

35:03.840 --> 35:04.770
This can't be delayed.

35:05.970 --> 35:06.490
Okay.

35:45.840 --> 35:46.400
Hello?

35:47.570 --> 35:50.530
Siyue, where are you?

35:52.250 --> 35:53.970
Your father is ill.

35:55.400 --> 35:56.290
What?

36:04.010 --> 36:05.160
Now I cannot

36:06.330 --> 36:08.640
even protect my families.

36:10.050 --> 36:12.360
How can I be qualified to protect her?

36:33.640 --> 36:34.600
Hi, dad.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.840
Xianxian is so excellent.

36:37.050 --> 36:39.680
You are a student of a century-old top university.

36:40.090 --> 36:41.200
Have you visited the campus?

36:42.640 --> 36:43.730
I'm too busy to

36:43.730 --> 36:45.330
look around.

36:45.680 --> 36:46.880
Hold on. You mother wants to talk to you.

36:48.090 --> 36:49.920
Xianxian, have you arrived at your dormitory?

36:50.490 --> 36:51.440
No, not yet.

36:51.490 --> 36:52.290
I'll be there later.

36:52.600 --> 36:54.440
It's near noon. Why don't you go to your dorm first?

36:54.440 --> 36:55.570
What are you up to?

36:55.570 --> 36:57.090
I should have gone with you.

36:58.530 --> 36:59.400
Okay, mom.

36:59.400 --> 37:00.730
I'll call you tonight.

37:00.810 --> 37:01.970
I've got to go.

37:02.120 --> 37:03.970
Don't forget to send me some photos.

37:14.970 --> 37:15.970
Okay, mom.

37:17.330 --> 37:18.840
Don't worry.

37:19.160 --> 37:20.200
It was too late to get there today.

37:20.600 --> 37:22.200
We'd better go earlier next time.

37:22.400 --> 37:23.920
How is grandpa doing recently?

37:26.770 --> 37:28.680
I heard that the winner of the gold medal in the Computer Department

37:28.680 --> 37:30.090
is our direct senior.

37:30.570 --> 37:31.290
What's his name?

37:35.160 --> 37:36.680
It's you.

37:36.840 --> 37:37.840
We are just talking about

37:37.840 --> 37:39.360
whether our roommate is you.

37:39.640 --> 37:40.770
Good for you.

37:40.770 --> 37:42.490
Everyone in Class One knows you.

37:42.810 --> 37:43.290
Here. Sit down.

37:46.440 --> 37:47.490
No, you can sit.

37:47.680 --> 37:49.290
Sit down. I'll stand here. I'm trying to lose weight.

37:52.050 --> 37:54.010
Well, I'm Lou Feng.

37:55.050 --> 37:55.970
I'm Ding Xian.

37:56.600 --> 37:57.120
Nice to see you.

37:57.810 --> 37:59.640
This is Ban Jiayu.

38:00.160 --> 38:01.880
This is Xu Shasha.

38:03.600 --> 38:05.880
You was dragged away by him, wasn't you?

38:06.090 --> 38:08.440
I heard that the boy you like

38:08.490 --> 38:09.570
is in Computer Department.

38:10.160 --> 38:11.330
And he's super handsome.

38:11.730 --> 38:13.010
Why haven't I heard of him before?

38:13.730 --> 38:15.250
You don't know that.

38:15.440 --> 38:17.440
I'll introduce the basic information to you.

38:18.090 --> 38:20.440
In our department, there are two popular students.

38:20.680 --> 38:22.490
One is Dong Zhengfei.

38:22.730 --> 38:23.600
The other is

38:23.640 --> 38:24.970
your Zhou Siyue.

38:24.970 --> 38:26.050
No kidding?

38:26.160 --> 38:27.970
I've heard about Dong Zhengfei

38:27.970 --> 38:29.120
before the school starts.

38:29.530 --> 38:30.840
But Zhou Siyue,

38:31.290 --> 38:32.600
I have no impression on him.

38:33.050 --> 38:34.400
Let me finish.

38:34.730 --> 38:35.770
They have

38:35.770 --> 38:37.360
something in common though.

38:37.490 --> 38:39.440
They have totally different dispositions.

38:39.770 --> 38:40.680
One is like fire

38:41.010 --> 38:41.880
while the other is like ice.

38:42.730 --> 38:45.920
You've just mentioned a robot...

38:45.920 --> 38:46.840
Robot competition.

38:47.120 --> 38:49.640
The award ceremony of the robot competition will be held tomorrow.

38:49.770 --> 38:52.530
I think the winner will be Dong Zhengfei

38:52.680 --> 38:53.530
or Zhou Siyue.

38:53.640 --> 38:54.360
You are so noisy.

39:01.290 --> 39:01.970
Never mind.

39:03.730 --> 39:05.970
It's okay. I'll go with you tomorrow.

39:36.640 --> 39:37.200
Start.

40:07.920 --> 40:09.200
The end of the world.

41:37.360 --> 41:39.290
The autumn sky is clear and the air is crisp.

41:39.290 --> 41:41.010
Students from all over the country come to schools.

41:41.330 --> 41:42.840
It's time to welcome new arrivals again.

41:42.970 --> 41:44.290
A large number of freshmen

41:44.290 --> 41:46.840
enter the university with their dreams.

41:47.250 --> 41:48.530
Our reporter also followed the students...

41:48.530 --> 41:49.200
No.

41:50.810 --> 41:51.490
It's okay.

41:51.490 --> 41:53.770
As we all know, embracing a long history, Huaqing University

41:53.770 --> 41:55.680
is well-known in China

41:56.010 --> 41:57.440
and it has always been the palace of knowledge

41:57.440 --> 41:59.250
in the eyes of many students.

41:59.640 --> 42:01.160
The Computer Department and Mathematics Department...

42:01.160 --> 42:02.010
Here.

42:03.250 --> 42:04.400
Eat an apple.

42:11.010 --> 42:12.250
Is everything okay

42:14.090 --> 42:15.440
in school?

42:17.770 --> 42:19.050
Everything is okay.

42:20.010 --> 42:21.360
Just rest assured and take good care of yourself.

42:24.330 --> 42:25.530
That's good.

42:27.120 --> 42:28.640
Don't be so tired like this.

42:29.810 --> 42:31.730
You should take study as your priority.

42:32.770 --> 42:34.880
Don't come here too often.

42:35.400 --> 42:36.400
I'm fine.

42:40.290 --> 42:41.200
Siyue is here.

42:43.490 --> 42:44.530
You have left for quite a while.

42:44.810 --> 42:46.090
Are you lost again?

42:47.360 --> 42:49.330
Could you please think something better on me?

42:50.160 --> 42:52.290
Have you found the cashier?

42:54.920 --> 42:56.250
Of course.

42:56.770 --> 42:58.400
Your mother is

42:58.770 --> 43:00.970
qualified enough for handling all these.

43:02.050 --> 43:03.570
Don't worry about this stuff.

43:04.010 --> 43:05.530
Just study hard

43:06.290 --> 43:08.570
and get the quota for going abroad settled.

43:09.330 --> 43:10.880
Mr. Ye has told us

43:11.570 --> 43:12.920
that you stand a great chance.

43:14.730 --> 43:16.770
It's too early to talk about this.

43:18.050 --> 43:20.810
It's not too late to think about it after dad gets well.

43:23.680 --> 43:25.440
Then I'll go back to school now.

43:25.970 --> 43:27.440
Call me if you need me.

43:29.970 --> 43:31.730
Will you come this evening?

43:33.250 --> 43:34.680
I'm kind of busy these days.

43:34.810 --> 43:36.160
I'll come again on weekends.

43:37.400 --> 43:38.680
You study so hard

43:38.970 --> 43:40.400
and do several jobs.

43:40.920 --> 43:42.160
Remember to have meals regularly.

43:42.400 --> 43:43.400
Okay, I will.

43:49.330 --> 43:49.970
I have to go now.

43:53.250 --> 43:54.010
Siyue

44:00.530 --> 44:01.400
Take good care of yourself.

44:03.530 --> 44:04.250
See you.

44:18.200 --> 44:21.290
Winning teams of the 2012 robot competition.

44:21.530 --> 44:24.010
Please appoint representatives to the stage to get the awards in turn.

44:24.290 --> 44:26.360
Let's welcome Li Minghao

44:27.880 --> 44:28.970
and Liu Zhenghui.

44:30.200 --> 44:31.840
The team from

44:31.840 --> 44:33.770
the Department of Automation won the first prize.

44:34.970 --> 44:35.880
Welcome

44:37.290 --> 44:38.330
Dong Zhengfei.

44:41.330 --> 44:42.810
Now, let's warmly welcome Professor Ye

44:42.810 --> 44:43.970
to give them the awards.

44:51.680 --> 44:53.250
He is just a representative to receive the award.

44:54.160 --> 44:55.120
It's a team award.

44:55.120 --> 44:56.400
Look at him.

44:57.120 --> 44:58.530
It seems that he is receiving a personal award.

45:01.440 --> 45:03.160
You are just jealous.

45:04.090 --> 45:05.600
If you prepare for it earnestly,

45:06.050 --> 45:07.290
how could he get the award?

45:09.200 --> 45:10.680
Let's go. It's about to finish.

45:15.090 --> 45:16.050
I now declare

45:16.330 --> 45:18.050
the competition a great success.

45:18.200 --> 45:19.810
Please leave in order.

45:25.090 --> 45:26.160
Excuse me.

45:26.250 --> 45:28.010
Sorry, I don't add strangers on WeChat.

45:28.530 --> 45:30.050
Don't get me wrong.

45:30.360 --> 45:31.200
I just want to ask that

45:31.200 --> 45:33.250
you are in the same class with Zhou Siyue, right?

45:33.730 --> 45:34.920
I want to see him.

45:38.440 --> 45:39.200
It's you.

45:40.050 --> 45:41.160
You are still looking for him.

45:42.680 --> 45:43.970
We are in the same class,

45:44.120 --> 45:44.920
but

45:45.530 --> 45:46.400
we are not friends.

45:46.840 --> 45:48.050
Classmates don't always mean friends.

45:48.810 --> 45:49.570
You have come to the wrong person.
